<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Rubbermaid upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Rubbermaid upgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- EVEREN Securities Inc said Friday it upgraded its intermediate-term rating on Rubbermaid Inc to market performer from market underperformer.  It is maintaining its long-term rating of market performer.</p>
<p>-- EVEREN said Rubbermaid's sale of its Office Products business will improve financial flexibility for other initiatives.  </p>
<p>-- Given the improved flexibility as well as slightly improved fundametals, EVEREN sees the stock performing more in line with market averages.</p>
<p>-- Shares of Rubbermaid were up 1/2 at 25-1/8.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
